### 지금 비밀번호를 틀리게 보내기
PATCH http://localhost:4001/members/bomi@example.com/password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "club2025!",
  "newPassword": "spring2026!"
}

### 비밀번호 바꾸기
PATCH http://localhost:4001/members/bomi@example.com/password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "club2026!",
  "newPassword": "spring2026!"
}

### 옛 비밀번호로 로그인
POST http://localhost:4001/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bomi@example.com",
  "password": "club2026!"
}

### 새 비밀번호로 로그인
POST http://localhost:4001/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bomi@example.com",
  "password": "spring2026!"
